# Docker matches each pattern against the whole path from the context root,
# so a bare name only covers the top level; `**/` covers nested copies
# (apps/*/node_modules, apps/*/.svelte-kit, local dev databases, infra/.env.dev).
# `build` and `data` stay top-level only: src/lib/cards/build and
# src/lib/climate/data are source.
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.svelte-kit
build
apps/*/build
dist
coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
data
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
*.md
!README.md
